Description: |
  Documents the router as the composition root of the HTTP request-handling spine:
  it walks the module graph from core/injector, resolves guards/pipes/interceptors
  from their respective cells, and registers the resulting composed handlers on the
  `AbstractHttpAdapter` from core/adapters, falling back to common/exceptions
  types for its own not-found and exception-mapping paths.
